---
import BaseHead from '../../../components/BaseHead.astro';
import FooterScripts from '../../../components/FooterScripts.astro';
import SrkrHeader from '../../../components/SrkrHeader.astro';
import SrkrFooter from '../../../components/SrkrFooter.astro';
import OffCanvas from '../../../components/OffCanvas.astro';
import DeptNav from '../../../components/DeptNav.astro';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <BaseHead title="Department of Mechanical Engineering | SRKR Engineering College" description="Department of Mechanical Engineering at SRKR Engineering College, Bhimavaram — established 1980, NBA accredited (4x), offering B.Tech ME and M.Tech CAD/CAM." />
  </head>
  <body>
    <SrkrHeader />

    <!-- BREADCRUMB -->
    <section class="rts-breadcrumb breadcrumb-height breadcumb-bg" style="background-image: url(/assets/images/faculty/mechanical/mechhome.jpeg);">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="row">
          <div class="col-12">
            <div class="breadcrumb-content">
              <ul class="breadcrumb">
                <li class="breadcrumb-item"><a href="/">Home</a></li>
                <li class="breadcrumb-item"><a href="/departments">Departments</a></li>
              </ul>
              <h1 class="section-title">Department of Mechanical Engineering</h1>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <!-- BREADCRUMB AREA END -->

    <!-- content -->
    <div class="rts-faculty-details py-5">
      <div class="container">

        <DeptNav dept="mechanical" current="Home" />

        <!-- About the Department -->
        <div class="row align-items-center justify-content-md-center mb-5 pb-5">
          <div class="col-lg-6 col-md-11">
            <div class="faculty-content-text me-5">
              <h3 class="rts-section-title mb-5">About the Department</h3>
              
              
              <p style="text-align: justify;">Mechanical Engineering Department is one of the oldest departments of the institute which was established in 1980. It is also one of the largest in terms of faculty, students, and activities, continues to lead and expand its activities in various directions. The department offers B.Tech. MTech. and Ph.D. programs with a wide choice of specializations, electives and research areas. The department was accredited four times by National Board of Accreditation (NBA) and was recognised as research centre by the Andhra University and Jawaharlal Nehru Technological University Kakinada (JNTUK).</p>
              <p style="text-align: justify;">The Department has 40 faculty members: 9 Professors, 1 Associate Professor, 30 Assistant Professors and 19 supporting staff. The department is having highly qualified and experienced faculty in all streams of Mechanical Engineering. About 55% of the faculty members have doctoral degrees and the rest are pursuing their Ph.Ds. About 450 research papers have been published in various International and National Journals/Conferences in the last few years.</p>
              <p style="text-align: justify;">The department is very well equipped with computational facilities and resources both in terms of hardware and software. Department has more than 160 computing systems and workstations loaded with wide range of software products covering all areas of mechanical engineering. Experimental and computational facilities are being continuously upgraded. The Department has Association of Mechanical Engineering which is a forum for students to develop their professional skills. Students are also encouraged to take part in awareness campaigns that have social relevance. Alumni of the department have occupied very high positions at National and International level.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="col-lg-6 col-md-11">
            <div class="ratio ratio-16x9 mt-5 mt-lg-0">
              <iframe
                src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/zWHp1cRW8fc?html5=1&enablejsapi=1"
                title="SRKR Department Video"
                loading="lazy"
                allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share"
                referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin"
                allowfullscreen
              ></iframe>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Message from HoD -->
        <div class="row mt--30">
          <div class="rts-section mb--60">
            <h3 class="rts-section-title">Message from Head of the Department</h3>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
          <div class="col-lg-4 col-md-8">
            <div class="faculty-image text-center">
              {/* TODO: replace with real HoD photograph at /assets/images/faculty/mechanical/hod.jpg */}
              <img class="img-fluid mw-100" src="/assets/images/faculty/mechanical/528.jpg" alt="Dr. K. Sita Rama Raju">
              <div class="h5 mb-2 mt-5">Dr. K. Sita Rama Raju</div>
              <span>Professor &amp; Head of the Department</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="col-lg-8">
            <div class="faculty-content-text ms-lg-5 mt-5 mt-lg-0">
              <p class="h6 mb-4">Welcome to the Department of Mechanical Engineering</p>
              <p style="text-align: justify;">The department is committed to equip our students with Industry 4.0 competencies, by aligning curriculum, laboratory experiences, and projects with emerging industry needs. Our vibrant student clubs provide ample opportunities to develop teamwork, leadership, and project management skills that complement classroom learning. Access to modern design and analysis software—CAD, FEA, CFD, and systems design tools—creates endless possibilities for research, capstone projects, and enhanced employability for the next generation of engineers. Take advantage of our specialized labs and Centre of Excellence (CoE) in the areas of manufacturing, drones and mechatronics, thermal and fluid systems, materials and composites, additive manufacturing, automotive systems, and renewable energy—to develop domain expertise that recruiters value.</p>
              <p style="text-align: justify;">A prime focus is to encourage internships at premier research centres and industry partners so students gain hands on exposure and real world problem solving experience, and to strengthen employer engagement and targeted training to achieve prominent placement outcomes. We guide every student to actively pursue internships, participate in clubs, professional societies and projects, and build a demonstrable portfolio of work; the faculty mentors and the administration are here to support you on this journey.</p>
            
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="border-top my-60 my_sm--10"></div>

          <!-- Mission & Vision -->
          <div class="row g-4 align-items-start justify-content-md-center">
            <div class="col-lg-6 col-md-6 rts-scholarship-description">
              <div class="faculty-content-text si__list h-100">
                <h4 class="font-32 mb-3 mt-4">Vision</h4>
                <ul class="list-unstyled one-column-list mb-0">
                  <li class="mb-3">To be recognised globally for quality education, training, and research, leading to well-qualified engineers who are innovative, entrepreneurial, and successful in solving the problems of society.</li>
                </ul>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-lg-6 col-md-6 rts-scholarship-description">
              <div class="faculty-content-text si__list h-100">
                <h4 class="font-32 mb-4">Mission</h4>
                <ul class="list-unstyled one-column-list">


                  
                  <li class="mb-3">To impart quality education to students to enhance their skills and make them globally competitive mechanical engineers.</li>
                  <li class="mb-3">To maintain a vital and state-of-the-art research environment providing students and faculty opportunities to create, interpret, apply, and disseminate knowledge.</li>
                  <li class="mb-3">To prepare graduates to pursue higher studies, serve the profession, and meet intellectual, ethical, and career challenges.</li>
                </ul>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Core Specializations --> 
        <div class="row g-5 faculty-sub-details rts-section-padding pt_sm--40">
          <div class="rts-section mb-4 text-center">
            <h3 class="rts-section-title">Core Specializations</h3>
          </div>

          <div class="col-lg-3 col-md-4 col-sm-6">
            <div class="single-cat-item civil-spec-card">
              <div class="cat-thumb civil-spec-thumb">
                <img src="/assets/images/specilization/cadcam.jpg" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
              </div>
              <div class="cat-meta">
                <div class="cat-title">
                  <a href="/departments/mechanical/research-consultancy/">CAD/CAM</a>
                </div>
                <div class="cat-link">
                  <a href="/departments/mechanical/research-consultancy/" class="cat-link-arrow"><i class="fa-sharp fa-regular fa-arrow-right"></i></a>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="col-lg-3 col-md-4 col-sm-6">
            <div class="single-cat-item civil-spec-card">
              <div class="cat-thumb civil-spec-thumb">
                <img src="/assets/images/specilization/thermal.jpeg" alt="Thermal Engineering" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
              </div>
              <div class="cat-meta">
                <div class="cat-title">
                  <a href="/departments/mechanical/research-consultancy/">Thermal Engineering</a>
                </div>
                <div class="cat-link">
                  <a href="/departments/mechanical/research-consultancy/" class="cat-link-arrow"><i class="fa-sharp fa-regular fa-arrow-right"></i></a>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="col-lg-3 col-md-4 col-sm-6">
            <div class="single-cat-item civil-spec-card">
              <div class="cat-thumb civil-spec-thumb">
                <img src="/assets/images/specilization/manufacture.jpeg" alt="Manufacturing Engineering" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
              </div>
              <div class="cat-meta">
                <div class="cat-title">
                  <a href="/departments/mechanical/research-consultancy/">Manufacturing Engineering</a>
                </div>
                <div class="cat-link">
                  <a href="/departments/mechanical/research-consultancy/" class="cat-link-arrow"><i class="fa-sharp fa-regular fa-arrow-right"></i></a>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="col-lg-3 col-md-4 col-sm-6">
            <div class="single-cat-item civil-spec-card">
              <div class="cat-thumb civil-spec-thumb">
                <img src="/assets/images/specilization/industry.jpeg" alt="Industrial Engineering" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
              </div>
              <div class="cat-meta">
                <div class="cat-title">
                  <a href="/departments/mechanical/research-consultancy/">Industrial Engineering</a>
                </div>
                <div class="cat-link">
                  <a href="/departments/mechanical/research-consultancy/" class="cat-link-arrow"><i class="fa-sharp fa-regular fa-arrow-right"></i></a>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Academics & Programs -->
        <div class="row justify-content-md-center g-0">
          <div class="rts-section mb--60 text-center">
            <h3 class="rts-section-title">Academics &amp; Programs</h3>
          </div>
          <div class="col-lg-4 col-md-10">
            <div class="program__single--item">
              <div class="program__single--item--bg">
                <img src="/assets/images/program/program__bg.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
              </div>
              <h5 class="program__single--item--title">Undergraduate</h5>
              <ul class="program__single--item--list">
                <li class="program__single--item--list--item">
                  <a href="/departments/mechanical/academic-programs/" class="link__list">B.Tech Mechanical Engineering
                    <span><i class="fa-regular fa-arrow-right"></i></span>
                  </a>
                </li>
                <li class="program__single--item--list--item">
                  <a href="/departments/mechanical/academic-programs/" class="link__list">4-Year JNTUK Affiliated
                    <span><i class="fa-regular fa-arrow-right"></i></span>
                  </a>
                </li>
                <li class="program__single--item--list--item">
                  <a href="/departments/mechanical/academic-programs/" class="link__list">NBA Accredited (4×)
                    <span><i class="fa-regular fa-arrow-right"></i></span>
                  </a>
                </li>
                <li class="program__single--item--list--item">
                  <a href="/departments/mechanical/academic-programs/" class="link__list">Industry-Aligned Curriculum
                    <span><i class="fa-regular fa-arrow-right"></i></span>
                  </a>
                </li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="col-lg-4 col-md-10">
            <div class="program__single--item v__2">
              <div class="program__single--item--bg">
                <img src="/assets/images/program/program__bg.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
              </div>
              <h5 class="program__single--item--title">Postgraduate</h5>
              <ul class="program__single--item--list">
                <li class="program__single--item--list--item">
                  <a href="/departments/mechanical/academic-programs/" class="link__list">M.Tech CAD/CAM
                    <span><i class="fa-regular fa-arrow-right"></i></span>
                  </a>
                </li>
                <li class="program__single--item--list--item">
                  <a href="/departments/mechanical/academic-programs/" class="link__list">2-Year JNTUK Affiliated
                    <span><i class="fa-regular fa-arrow-right"></i></span>
                  </a>
                </li>
                <li class="program__single--item--list--item">
                  <a href="/departments/mechanical/academic-programs/" class="link__list">Advanced CAD &amp; Simulation Studios
                    <span><i class="fa-regular fa-arrow-right"></i></span>
                  </a>
                </li>
                <li class="program__single--item--list--item">
                  <a href="/departments/mechanical/academic-programs/" class="link__list">Research &amp; Thesis Track
                    <span><i class="fa-regular fa-arrow-right"></i></span>
                  </a>
                </li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="col-lg-4 col-md-10">
            <div class="program__single--item">
              <div class="program__single--item--bg">
                <img src="/assets/images/program/program__bg.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
              </div>
              <h5 class="program__single--item--title">Research</h5>
              <ul class="program__single--item--list">
                <li class="program__single--item--list--item">
                  <a href="/departments/mechanical/research-consultancy/" class="link__list">Ph.D. Programs (JNTUK)
                    <span><i class="fa-regular fa-arrow-right"></i></span>
                  </a>
                </li>
                <li class="program__single--item--list--item">
                  <a href="/departments/mechanical/research-consultancy/" class="link__list">Thermal &amp; Materials Research
                    <span><i class="fa-regular fa-arrow-right"></i></span>
                  </a>
                </li>
                <li class="program__single--item--list--item">
                  <a href="/departments/mechanical/research-consultancy/" class="link__list">Industry MoUs &amp; Consultancy
                    <span><i class="fa-regular fa-arrow-right"></i></span>
                  </a>
                </li>
                <li class="program__single--item--list--item">
                  <a href="/departments/mechanical/research-consultancy/" class="link__list">450+ Research Publications
                    <span><i class="fa-regular fa-arrow-right"></i></span>
                  </a>
                </li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
    <!-- content end -->

    <!-- Department Highlights -->
    <div class="rts-blog v_1 rts__light rts-section-padding">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="row justify-content-md-center">
          <div class="col-md-11 col-lg-12">
            <div class="rts-section rts-border-bottom-1 mb--50 pb--20">
              <h2 class="rts-section-title text-uppercase">Department Highlights</h2>
              <p class="rts-section-description">Four decades of excellence in mechanical engineering education, research, and industry partnerships.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
     
      </div>
    </div>
    <!-- Department Highlights end -->

    <SrkrFooter />
    <OffCanvas />
    <FooterScripts />

    <style>
      /* Equal-height specialization cards */
      .civil-spec-card {
        height: 100%;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
      }
      .civil-spec-thumb {
        height: 220px;
        overflow: hidden;
      }
      .civil-spec-thumb img {
        width: 100%;
        height: 100%;
        object-fit: cover;
        display: block;
      }
    </style>
  </body>
</html>
